{"id":"minimo","lemma":"minimo","pos":"adj","rank":1377,"glosses":["minimum; (the) least, (the) smallest, (the) slightest, (the) lowest","very small, very little, tiny, very low, minimum"],"ipa":"/ˈmi.ni.mo/","forms":{"feminine":"minima","masculinePlural":"minimi","femininePlural":"minime"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-minimo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Il pericolo è minimo.","en":"The danger is minimal.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"peril, danger"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"I rischi sono minimi.","en":"The risks are minimal.","words":[{"g":"the","l":"la"},{"g":"risk","l":"rischio"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"Non ne ho la minima idea.","en":"I haven't the slightest idea.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"of it"},{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"idea"}]},{"text":"Il danno era minimo.","en":"The damage was minimal.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"damage, harm, injury"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"Ho fatto il minimo.","en":"I did the minimum.","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}